<title>MALAYSIA: Seal stock suspended pending news -KLSE.</title>
<headline>Seal stock suspended pending news -KLSE.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The stock of Malaysian timber firm Seal Inc Bhd was suspended from Friday's trading pending a news announcement, an official at the Kuala Lumpur Stock Exchange said.</p>
<p>The stock was last traded at 3.20 ringgit.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-201 4813)</p>
</text>
